  "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n## 🚀 Features\r\n\r\n- Python 3.15 support @benfred (#878)\r\n- Add Windows ARM64 wheels @ndabas (#867)\r\n- Format function names with qualname for Python 3.11+ @jake-kramer (#825)\r\n- Classify 3.12+ frames by owner and mask stackref tag bits @korniltsev-grafanista (#884)\r\n- Use \\_Py\\_DebugOffsets to get imports modules address @benfred (#877)\r\n- Skip thread-name lookup for outputs that do not use names @jonashaag (#862)\r\n- Gate CLI dependencies behind optional `cli` feature flag @korniltsev-grafanista (#848)\r\n- Add thread name lookup tests, lookup again after 1 second if not matched at first @krassowski (#880)\r\n\r\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Fix getting thread names and copying PyLongObject on 32-bit arm @benfred (#888)\r\n- Minor fixes for python 3.15 @benfred (#886)\r\n- Fix line number at compact line table entry boundaries @korniltsev-grafanista (#883)\r\n- Fix excessive thread name lookups @tdryer (#790)\r\n- fix stack trace fetching on 32-bit cpython 3.14 @HiFiPhile (#856)\r\n- fix: don't read target-process bytes as `bool` @benfred (#876)\r\n- Fix image base calculation for PyInstaller MacOS bundles @trisiak (#858)\r\n- fix: bound thread and frame walk iterations, not pushed results @korniltsev-grafanista (#874)\r\n- fix: decode UCS-4 strings without char transmute UB @r3wretrhy (#875)\r\n- fix: avoid colons in default recording filenames @ryanchou1994 (#869)\r\n- fix: ignore ECHILD from Child::try\\_wait() when child was already reaped @sendaoYan (#871)\r\n- fix: get\\_mach\\_cpu\\_type do not mutate imutable variable with raw pointers @korniltsev-grafanista (#849)\r\n\r\n## 🧰 Maintenance\r\n\r\n- Update GHA to use python 3.14 by default @benfred (#901)\r\n- Drop unused pull-requests: write from build workflow @korniltsev-grafanista (#893)\r\n- Update remoteprocess dependency to 0.5.5 @benfred (#895)\r\n- Reduce GHA ci matrix size @benfred (#889)\r\n- update remoteprocess/proc-maps dependencies @benfred (#887)\r\n- Bump the github-actions group across 1 directory with 2 updates @[dependabot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/dependabot) (#864)\r\n",
